{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sophonce</strong> is a science fiction action horror first-person shooter that relies on philosophical undertones as the primary focus of the plot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074150/extras/a3d1e64957e991472736bbddb2c642d9.poster.avif?t=1761192168\" width=506 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074150/extras/a3d1e64957e991472736bbddb2c642d9.webm?t=1761192168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074150/extras/a3d1e64957e991472736bbddb2c642d9.mp4?t=1761192168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide array of telekinetic abilities and elemental weaponry at your disposal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflex Mode (Slo-Mo).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An impressive arsenal of weapons with each having unique attributes to them. Many different ammo types specific to each weapon such as stasis ammo, pyro ammo, gravity ammo, shock ammo, and rift ammo. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A riveting story that keeps track of your choices/actions that will ultimately determine the ending of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And....more to be disclosed in the future!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074150/extras/7817eeb57ad3c4fe884d744b9f8e4dcc.poster.avif?t=1761192168\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074150/extras/7817eeb57ad3c4fe884d744b9f8e4dcc.webm?t=1761192168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074150/extras/7817eeb57ad3c4fe884d744b9f8e4dcc.mp4?t=1761192168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Story Plot</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning of the year 2222, a revolutionary technological device proved the existence of a soul which solidified proof of a higher power. The year is now 2973. The vast majority of humanity has been tank-bred over the past centuries due to a highly contagious otherworldly virus that permanently altered reproductive genomes and therefore effectively sterilized most of humanity. A dire consequence of this artificial breeding is that those who are tank-bred are soulless. You are Matthew, one of the soulless, an experimental tank-bred super soldier part of the royal regime task force division. You are sent on your lonesome to investigate a distress signal from a research facility located in Poseidon, a water-rich planet found in &quot;The Black-Eye Galaxy&quot;. Luna, who is the Royal Protector of Mars, and her team were sent days before to investigate but communication with them has been lost. This is where your adventure begins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074150/extras/a1d37b1fc29f76e1450f8ef196cdafc8.poster.avif?t=1761192168\" width=506 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074150/extras/a1d37b1fc29f76e1450f8ef196cdafc8.webm?t=1761192168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074150/extras/a1d37b1fc29f76e1450f8ef196cdafc8.mp4?t=1761192168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pyromaniac","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074150/1d1de8ad1347249076cd3c7dd81318d3dfefe89c.jpg"},{"name":"Electrocutioner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074150/643e69f7f24b2576b3210e165ccf179925bf17c3.jpg"},{"name":"Red Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074150/9b2d93ccb967b1d9f62fb523ddc3f0098c204db9.jpg"},{"name":"Heavyweight Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074150/ead9d73fe25ffed9f75ce6b875b3dcbe681ee399.jpg"},{"name":"Is There No One Else?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074150/852b0ed9b4ef1948433f65b6ad850e19b06d3686.jpg"},{"name":"Negative Gravity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074150/6cf6de454ef743015d4a0d5de8d047fb82348bad.jpg"},{"name":"Prologue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074150/d015c48224d97cfea45f0722caaae6c5baff2710.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2074150/8f3732a8ae3ef0458651296bcf8fd2c0c16c376f.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2074150?t=1761192168","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761192168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074150/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761192168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074150/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761192168","categories":[